---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ConnectLinks from '../components/ConnectLinks.astro';
import { t } from '../utils/i18n';

const lang = 'it' as const;
---

<Layout title="Il progetto · Upupa">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <!-- Back to Hub / Breadcrumb -->
    <div class="mb-8">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-warm-700 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-warm-400 transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
        </svg>
        <span>upupa.life</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">
          Il progetto
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 italic font-serif">
          Un mondo, due espressioni.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Intro -->
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Upupa è lo spazio digitale in cui convivono due dimensioni complementari dello stesso mondo.
          Una raccoglie esperienze da vivere insieme, l'altra le storie che restano dopo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- The two dimensions -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900">
            Horizon
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">
            Esperienze condivise
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Un invito a uscire, scoprire luoghi e passare del tempo nella natura insieme ad altre persone.
            Upupa Horizon non organizza attività fine a sé stesse: crea occasioni per condividere esperienze.
          </p>
          <a href="/horizon/" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 hover:text-blue-800 dark:hover:text-blue-200">
            <span>Scopri Horizon</span>
            <span class="ml-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase rounded-full bg-warm-100 dark:bg-warm-950/60 text-warm-800 dark:text-warm-300 border border-warm-200 dark:border-warm-800">
            Journal
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-2">
            Storie e riflessioni
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Lo spazio personale dedicato a esperienze, pensieri, racconti e fotografia, pubblicati quando
            hanno trovato il loro momento, anche a distanza di tempo.
          </p>
          <a href="/journal/" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-warm-700 dark:text-warm-400 hover:text-warm-800 dark:hover:text-warm-300">
            <span>Entra nel Journal</span>
            <span class="ml-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Note on privacy of places -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-warm-50/80 dark:bg-zinc-900/80 border border-warm-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 mb-12">
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Le due dimensioni condividono una sensibilità verso la libertà, la scoperta e la natura, ma hanno
          funzioni diverse. Nessuna delle due è un'associazione, un'agenzia o un servizio a pagamento.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Social Links -->
      <ConnectLinks
        connectTitle={t('connect.title', lang)}
        telegramLabel={t('connect.telegram', lang)}
        channelLabel={t('connect.channel', lang)}
        instagramLabel={t('connect.instagram', lang)}
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
